336	     * is zero), 2 points for a household of 3 or more members ({@code householdMemberCount} is at least
337	     * 3), and 3 points for tenure &mdash; the number of elapsed fiscal years (the fiscal year starts on
338	     * 1 July) from {@code registrationDate} to today &mdash; of more than 1.
